{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "project-links-runspec",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.55: `project-links`, a PROJECT-domain run on three links, computed from the DEFAULT DATABASE plus the run's PROJECT input database, which `inputs/washtenaw-project-links.esm` declares. It selects source types 21 and 32 (gasoline, which MOVES widens to four fuels each), road types 1, 4 and 5, and four processes: running exhaust and start exhaust (CO and Total Energy), brake wear (PM10 and PM2.5) and tire wear (PM10 and PM2.5).\n\nWHAT IT EXERCISES, all selected in the model by `run_isProjectDomain` and nothing written here: ProjectTAG's SHO on two links of different road types, speeds, lengths and source-type shares (`act_projectSho`, per road type); LinkOperatingModeDistributionGenerator's distribution per link (`lomd_*`, per road type, brackets 1021/153 at 30 mph and 1041/1030 at 25 mph); brake wear's unfolded distribution (`lomd_WBrake`); tire wear's one mode per link (`lomd_tireW`: 407 and 406); ProjectTAG's Starts from offNetworkLink (`st_projectStarts`) and the user's start modes (`sod_weight`), on the off-network link 3; and MOVESOutput's link per road type (`out_linkID`).\n\n`n_outputRate` IS 3412: the run's MOVESOutput rows. `run_domainUnported` is 0.\n\n`db_movesoutput` is DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING, as in every RunSpec here.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "fixture",
      "onroad",
      "default-database",
      "project-domain"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_runspecyear": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/project-links/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecyear.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecyear"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, yearID 2020. The scope comes from these tables and never from the RunSpec XML, whose @key attributes are 0-based indices into sorted ID lists (docs/mixed-onroad.md §0.1).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecmonth": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/project-links/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecmonth.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecmonth"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, monthID 8.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspechour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/project-links/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspechour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, hourID 9. `<beginhour key=\"8\">` is a 0-based index into the sorted hour list (docs/mixed-onroad.md 0.1).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_aggregationhour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/project-links/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_aggregationhour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "The hours the run aggregates over. This run does not set `aggregateBy`, so it is `runspechour` itself and the same file.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/project-links/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspechourday.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, dayID 5 (weekday). The second factor of the activity axis and of the output axis, and its extent is one in this run: `<day id=\"5\">` selects one day type where the earlier `<day key=\"5\">` was an out-of-range INDEX and fell back to both (moves.rs PR #55).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_rateday": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/project-links/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0236_campuscluster_illinois_edu__runspecday.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_rateday"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "The day types the RATE-side time pre-aggregation is scoped to. This run does not set `aggregateBy`, so it is `runspecday` itself and the same file: the pre-aggregation averages over one cell and returns the table's own value. A run that aggregates points this somewhere else, because MOVES overwrites `runspecday` with the synthesized output day AFTER the pre-aggregation has run.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
